  "transcript_top_n": 120,

  "_quota_note": "search.list = 100 units each. max_discovery_searches * 100 is the discovery cost. Everything downstream is ~1 unit per 50 items. Default config costs roughly 800 + ~150 = under 1000 of the 10000 daily units."
